flowchart TD
    A[Customer Action] --> B{Does the system make a promise?}
    B -- No --> C[Approximate or Informational Response]
    B -- Yes --> D[Identify System of Record]
    D --> E[Validate Required State]
    E --> F{State Confirmed?}
    F -- Yes --> G[Commit and Record Evidence]
    F -- No --> H[Retry, Degrade, Refuse, or Escalate]
    G --> I[Expose Confirmation to Customer]
    H --> J[Explain Safe Next Step]
